    'aboutUsPage' => 'Would you like to study in the Ukraine? Our company can help you all the time! More than 60,000 students annually take such decisions and successfully enroll in Ukrainian universities. In Ukraine there are more than 200 institutions that can offer you studying in English. We have been successfully working with the best of them. We take an active part in the cultural and social life of our students. Nowadays in Ukraine is the most loyal type of enrollment for international students. It is extremely difficult to enroll for the Medical Faculty in other European countries. Only in Ukraine there are such good conditions for studying and living for international students. Parents of international students from more than 10 countries rely on us to ensure a carefree enrollment and education of their children. With our experience of over than 10 years, we and our partners can ensure each applicant a quality solution for any purpose which he/she set. We will help you to solve most efficiently any question about studying, accommodation and further employment in Ukraine. Haven’t you chosen the university yet? Haven’t you decided on a profession? Do you not know all the details of the enrollment? We will help you.
     Our team specialists will help you to choose the best option in different training courses. They will help you to assess your chances and arrange documents, they will meet you, help you to enroll in the selected university and learn carefree during student life. In Ukraine, you can find the highest qualitative and affordable education, compared with all other EU countries. We have earned this authority with long-term practice and hundreds of successful students who have chosen us. Student life in Ukraine is the best that you can find in your life! With our opportunities all your wishes will come true.',
